OL,3,GNEWSATribute paid to woman, 23, found
OL,4,Adead in Islington
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 23-year-old woman found
OL,7,Fdead in north London said they have
OL,8,Fbeen left with "an immeasurable void"
OL,9,Fin their lives.
OL,11,FClara Bale, who has for the first time
OL,12,Fbeen formally identified by the Met
OL,13,FPolice, was found unresponsive at an
OL,14,Faddress in Bollinder Place, Islington,
OL,15,Fon the morning of 6 August and
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FFour women aged 20, 21, 23 and 26 and
OL,19,Ftwo men aged 21 and 24 who were
OL,20,Farrested on suspicion of murder have
OL,21,Fsince been released on bail.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
