OL,3,GNEWSATribute paid to woman, 23, found
OL,4,Adead in Islington
OL,5,
OL,6,FBale's family released a statement
OL,7,Fthrough the Met that said: "Clara was a
OL,8,Fbrilliant young woman filled with
OL,9,Fdreams, a bright light whose loss has
OL,10,Fleft an immeasurable void in our
OL,11,Flives."
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
